        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Splashdown is a water racing video game for the Xbox and Sony PlayStation 2. It can be played by one or two players. Splashdown is quite similar to Nintendo's Wave Race series. Players take control of a personal water craft as they race against each other on various courses. Players must pass the correct side of buoys on the way or the personal water craft may stall as a penalty or they get splashed by a whales tail.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Splashdown es un videojuego de carreras acuáticas para Xbox y PlayStation 2. Puede jugarse de uno o dos jugadores. Splashdown es bastante parecido a la serie Wave Race de Nintendo. Los jugadores controlan una moto de agua mientras compiten entre sí en distintos circuitos. Deben pasar las boyas por el lado correcto; si no lo hacen, la moto de agua puede calarse como penalización o ser golpeada por la cola de una ballena.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
